    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d367">

                <pb facs="0480" n="1234" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp02v02/pg1234"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 841.731/1769</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in Great Britain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Page</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-05-21T12:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 21, 1917, 12 noon</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>4856. Your 6059, April 21, 6 p.m. Re-establishment British censorship desirable.
                    Please so inform British Government and request they designate representative,
                    if practicable a member of the commission now here, to confer with United States
                    chief cable censor with a view to uniformity of regulations, efficiency of
                    operation and exchange of information.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
